  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "kt_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -384
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Kinetic typography\n\nEach character of every row gets its own (x, y). The phrase is split into a Spread<string> then Repeat-tiled rows times — paired with a Range of the same length, ForEach iterates the 24 × 9 grid. Inside: floor / mod recover (rowIdx, charIdx); the column offset (charIdx − centre) gets multiplied by a row-envelope so middle rows fan out and edges stay tight. The result curves like the reference — a wave of letterforms.\n\nEdit the String node to change the phrase; the grid count rebuilds itself.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Kinetic typography\n\nEach character of every row gets its own (x, y). The phrase is split into a Spread<string> then Repeat-tiled rows times — paired with a Range of the same length, ForEach iterates the 24 × 9 grid. Inside: floor / mod recover (rowIdx, charIdx); the column offset (charIdx − centre) gets multiplied by a row-envelope so middle rows fan out and edges stay tight. The result curves like the reference — a wave of letterforms.\n\nEdit the String node to change the phrase; the grid count rebuilds itself.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320
      }
    },
